	"readme": "# bare-path\n\nPath manipulation library for JavaScript.\n\n```\nnpm i bare-path\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```js\nconst path = require('bare-path')\n\npath.join('foo', 'bar') // foo/bar on posix, foo\\bar on windows\n```\n\n## License\n\nApache-2.0"
